# Mike's UI (MUI)

Workshop-safe custom UI compositor for Arma Reforger. Enfusion has no WebView. MUI is a retained node graph; Enfusion widgets are only the compositor.

**Library:** `F:\Mikes-UI` (addon ID `MikesUI`, GUID `B3F91C6A4E275D08`). Must depend on Arma Reforger `58D0FB3206B6F859`. Edit MUI **there**, not in I&A.
**Consumer:** this repo (`F:\Mikes-Invade-and-Annex`, GUID `6556458885927F2F`) depends on MikesUI in `addon.gproj`.
**Consumers:** `IA_AdminConfigMenu`, `IA_StatisticsMenu` (interactive menus via `IA_MikesMenuHost`), `IA_NotificationDisplay` (HUD via `MountPassive`). Pause menu stays vanilla.
**Prefix:** `MUI_` in the addon, `IA_` in I&A. Never edit GameSources.

Enforce: no ternary. Every `new` script object must live in a `ref` (member, local, or `ref array<ref T>`). Factories `Retain()` into `MUI_Runtime.m_aOwned` before return. No `?:`. Call `super` unless replacing. Server-authoritative gameplay stays in I&A; MUI is client UI.

## I&A consumer pattern

Menus use `IA_MikesMenuHost` (`Scripts/Game/UI/IA_MikesMenuHost.c`) to create the fullscreen host Frame, `Mount`, hide legacy layout children, Tick + `MenuWithEditorContext`, and Unmount. Build Overlay → FxBackdrop → Card with staggered `SetIntro`. Store every control as `protected ref MUI_*`.

HUD toasts (`IA_NotificationDisplay`) do **not** use the menu host. They `MountPassive` on a host with `IGNORE_CURSOR`, build a pass-through overlay → Card, and Tick from `DisplayUpdate`. Never activate `MenuWithEditorContext` on the HUD.

When adding I&A UI: prefer MUI factories over new `.layout` composition. Do not re-investigate MUI internals; use the APIs below. If a compositor bug needs a fix, change `F:\Mikes-UI\Scripts\Game\`.

## Architecture

```
ChimeraMenuBase.OnMenuUpdate
  → MUI_Runtime.Tick(dt)          // always paints while mounted
      Tick tree (intro/hover/focus anim)
      Layout if dirty (MUI_LayoutEngine)
      Paint tree onto MUI_RenderSurface
```

Each `MUI_RenderSurface` = Frame + **CanvasWidget** (fills/strokes/circles) + **pooled TextWidget** layer (glyphs). Clip/scroll nodes get extra surfaces (`CLIPCHILDREN` frames). Hidden **EditBoxWidget** (`MUI_EditBridge`) is the only typing/IME/console VK path.

**Layers (z-order):** backdrop surface (FxBackdrop) → **BlurWidget** under each `MUI_Card` → chrome surface (cards/controls) → clip surfaces (scroll content). Cards use frosted `DeepFrost` fill so the blurred FX shows through. Toggle with `card.SetBlurEnabled(false)` / `SetBlurIntensity(0..1)`.

Layout space = reference/unscaled pixels (`DPIUnscale(GetScreenSize)`). Canvas vertices are **screen pixels** (`workspace.DPIScale`). Text `FrameSlot` stays unscaled. Clip frames use `node.DrawX/Y()` so they follow intro slide.

